# Day 02 — Services & Tags

## 🔹 Ansible — Install & Enable Nginx

---
- name: Install and Enable Ngnix on Rubi
  hosts: all
  become: yes

  tasks:
    - name: Install ngnix
      yum:
        name: ngnix
        state: present

    - name: Enable ngnix
      service:
        name: ngnix
        state: started
        enabled: yes    

## 🔹 Terraform — EC2 with Tags (r5.2xlarge)

provider "aws" {
    region = "eu-north-1"
}

resource "aws_instance" "rubi" {
    ami = "ami-0abcd1234abcd1234"
    instance_type = "r5.2xlarge"

    tags = {
        Name = "Rubi-Server"
        Environment = "Practice"
        Owner = "Rubi"
    }
}

## 🔹 Kubernetes — Deployment with 2 Replicas

apiVersion: v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: rubi-deployment
spec:
  replicas: 2
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: rubi-deployment 
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: rubi-deployment 
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: app
          image: ngnix
          ports:
            - containerPort: 80

